The '''Heart of the Forest''', commonly abbreviated as '''HotF''', is a [[Skill Tree]] related to {{Skill|Foraging}}. Leveling it awards [[Token of the Forest|{{DarkGreen|Tokens of the Forest}}]], which can be spent on various Perks found within the tree.

__TOC__
== Unlocking ==
The {{DarkGreen|Heart of the Forest}} is unlocked by completing the [[Quests#Heart of the Forest|Heart of the Forest]] quest from {{NPCSprite|Hina}} in {{Zone|Tangleburg's Path}}, which requires finishing talking to her and indirectly reaching {{Skill|Foraging 12}}.

As players tier up their {{DarkGreen|Heart of the Forest}}, they will gain [[Token of the Forest|{{DarkGreen|Tokens of the Forest}}]], which can be used to unlock various perks. Some of these perks will take effect only on {{Green|Public Islands}} with a special mining mechanism (alongside an infinite Mining Fatigue effect).

== UI ==
{{Heart of the Forest/UI}}

=== Accessing ===
* The menu can be accessed : 
** via the {{Code|/hotf}} command (anywhere)
** via the {{skl|Foraging}} menu (anywhere), 
** via the {{Item|SkyBlock Menu}} (while on {{Zone|Galatea}}, in other words at the {{zone|Moonglade Marsh}} and {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}}).

== Leveling ==
* Players can tier up their {{DarkGreen|Heart of the Forest}} by gaining {{HotF EXP}}, which can be accumulated by: 
** opening [[Tree Gift]]s on {{Zone|Galatea}};
** participating in a [[Starlyn Contest]]: {{See also|Starlyn Contests}}
*** Depending on their respective Point Brackets, they grant {{HotF EXP|100-750}} at the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}} and {{HotF EXP|150-900}} on the {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}}.
***The player can participate in both of their variants at the same time and reap their rewards, including {{HotF EXP}}.
*** The first {{Green|3}} daily [[Starlyn Contest]]s award an additional {{HotF EXP|+1200}}. At '''HotF Level''' {{Green|8}}, this bonus is replaced with {{Green|1,200}} {{Forest Whispers}} or {{Desert Whispers}} for {{NPCSprite|Agatha}}'s or {{NPCSprite|Miria}}'s contests.
*{{HotF EXP}} gains can be increased by {{green|1%}}→{{green|10%}} from the {{Attribute|Galatea Training}} attribute ({{Item|Ember Shard}}).
* The {{DarkGreen|Heart of the Forest}} can be reset. This reverts all perk purchases and reimburses all spent {{Forest Whispers}}, {{Desert Whispers}} and [[Token of the Forest|{{DarkGreen|Tokens of the Forest}}]]. 
** Tier and Center of the Forest levels are kept; thus powder spent on upgrading Center of the Forest is not reimbursed.

{{Heart of the Forest/Leveling Table}}

== Axe Abilities ==
*{{DarkGreen|Heart of the Forest}} Tiers {{green|2}} and {{green|6}} offer {{green|2}} and {{green|1}} {{Ability|Axe Abilities}} respectively.
*They can {{green|all}} be unlocked on the tree at once, but only {{green|one}} can be selected at a time.
*They are activated with {{Keypress|Right-Click}}, and have either an instant effect or a period of effect.
*They have a cooldown, which starts immediately upon activation, not at the point of the ability's conclusion.
**The player must wait for the cooldown to expire before being able to use any other {{Ability|Axe Ability}}.
**The cooldown is preserved across lobbies. {{ConfirmationNeeded}}
*They are at Level {{green|1}} by default, and are upgradeable to Level {{green|5}}{{ConfirmationNeeded}} by the following:
** Level {{green|1}} of the {{DarkGreen|Center of the Forest}} perk;
** {{More Info Needed}}
* They do not apply on [[Huntaxes]].
* They do not apply at the {{Zone|Hub}} despite the existence of Oak Trees.

