== Trivia ==
* While on {{Zone|Galatea}}, players with {{AN|Half Full}} enabled will have {{Rmt|&a⬓}} next to their name; likewise, players with {{AN|Half Empty}} enabled will have {{Rmt|&c⬒}} next to their name.
* Despite what the menu suggests, perks from the '''Heart of the Forest''' do not require certain perks to be chosen. They can be unlocked if an adjacent perk is also unlocked.
* The {{AN|Iron Lungs}} perk could be a reference to the video game and movie ''Iron Lung'', as both involve diving deep underwater for exploration. This, in turn, also references the medical device of the same name.
*Despite being impossible to get every single perk in the {{Green|Heart of the Forest}}, if one were to get all of them and max each one out (including '''Core of the Forest'''), it would cost:
**{{Forest Whispers|14,767,237}};
**{{Desert Whispers|52,672,500}};
**or a combined amount of {{green|67,439,737}} {{gold|Desert}} and {{Turquoise|Forest}} Whispers;
**{{green|35}} [[Tokens of the Forest|{{Green|Tokens of the Forest}}]].

